    end of this turn (even if this card leaves the field).\n\n[ Monster Effect ]
    \nWhile this Pendulum Summoned card is on the field, \"Magician\" Pendulum Monsters
    you control cannot be destroyed by your opponent's card effects during the turn
    this card was Pendulum Summoned."
